// PSync, Capture, Void, Refund and RSync follow the same shape. The request
// messages are:
//   PaymentServiceGetRequest      (PSync)
//   PaymentServiceCaptureRequest  (Capture)
//   PaymentServiceVoidRequest     (Void)
//   PaymentServiceRefundRequest   (Refund)
//   RefundServiceGetRequest       (RSync, via RefundServiceClient)
//
// Note for Capture: the domain-side `PaymentsCaptureData` has NO
// `payment_amount` field. Its real amount fields are `amount_to_capture: i64`
// (not an Option) and `minor_amount_to_capture: MinorUnit`
// (crates/types-traits/domain_types/src/connector_types.rs). A partial-capture
// check compares `amount_to_capture` against the authorized amount the
// connector itself returned - there is no field on the request that records it,
// so how you obtain it is connector-specific.
