// -> capture -> refund -> sync. Note it does its refund sync through
// PaymentServiceGetRequest / PaymentServiceClient::get; for the
// RefundServiceGetRequest + RefundServiceClient form named above, copy
// xendit_payment_flows_test.rs instead.
